+# The score-blind TRIPWIRE (rung-2 adjudication 2026-07-10): a live row with
+# kv_len > 2 equal to arange(min(kv_len, topk)) is the byte-exact output of
+# an all-tied/constant score row through both the DCP merge and the gate-off
+# hierarchical_topk tie breaks — automatic FAIL, even when both runs agree.
